<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle firm/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said a small supply of slaughter steers and heifers were firm to $0.50 higher for two days.</p>
<p>Steers - high select and choice 2-3 1300-1400 lbs 63.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs 63.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
